{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"content_width":"80ch","custom_padding":false,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40}},"blocks_PCcMBr":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_313f31d_UzzLpc":{"type":"ai_gen_block_313f31d","settings":{"mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/About_US_mobile_logo.png","desktop_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Imagee_for_About_us_3.png","height_mode":"auto","manual_height_mobile":500,"manual_height_desktop":500,"vertical_alignment_mobile":"flex-end","vertical_alignment_desktop":"flex-end","horizontal_alignment_mobile":"center","horizontal_alignment_desktop":"center","content_padding_bottom_mobile":40,"content_padding_bottom_desktop":60,"heading_to_button_spacing_mobile":0,"heading_to_button_spacing_desktop":0,"heading":"Where Wellness Lives","heading_font":"montserrat_n4","heading_size_mobile":28,"heading_size_desktop":60,"heading_color":"#2f2f2f","heading_alignment_mobile":"center","heading_alignment_desktop":"center","heading_spacing_mobile":44,"heading_spacing_desktop":0,"subheading":"","subheading_font":"montserrat_n4","subheading_size_mobile":18,"subheading_size_desktop":18,"subheading_color":"#2f2f2f","subheading_alignment_mobile":"center","subheading_alignment_desktop":"center","subheading_spacing_mobile":0,"subheading_spacing_desktop":0,"button_text":"","button_link":"","button_font":"sans_serif_n4","button_size_mobile":16,"button_size_desktop":18,"button_color":"#ffffff","button_alignment_mobile":"center","button_alignment_desktop":"center","button_spacing_mobile":0,"button_spacing_desktop":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_313f31d_UzzLpc"],"name":"Image with text overlay","settings":{}},"rich_text_JGmU6x":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"richtext_V3YzjV":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>There are moments in life when the world simply asks too much of us.<\/p><p>The days seem to move faster than ever. Notifications never stop. Work follows us home, and even when we finally find a quiet moment, our minds often refuse to slow down. Somewhere along the way, true relaxation became something we planned for rather than something we experienced.<\/p><p>Soluna was created to change that.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["richtext_V3YzjV"],"name":"Intro text","settings":{"full_width":true,"content_width":"large","text_position":"center","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","custom_padding":false,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40}},"17868690308f348f71":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_ab0d6b9_VP44BW":{"type":"ai_gen_block_ab0d6b9","disabled":true,"settings":{"story_font":"montserrat_n4","desktop_width_percent":100,"background":"#ffffff","text_color":"#1a1a1a","tab_color":"#677279","active_color":"#1a1a1a","underline_thickness":1,"image_height":600,"mobile_height":360,"radius":0,"tab_1_label":"We're","tab_1_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/We_Are_For_You_1.jpg","tab_1_eyebrow":"Safety ingredients","tab_1_heading":"More than a sauna","tab_1_body":"<p>A sauna is often seen as a product. We see it differently.<\/p>","tab_1_show_button":false,"tab_1_button":"Explore our story","tab_1_link":"","tab_2_label":"About","tab_2_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/We_Are_For_You_2.jpg","tab_2_eyebrow":"Thoughtful design","tab_2_heading":"Made for your rituals","tab_2_body":"<p>Beautiful wellness begins with considered details.<\/p>","tab_2_show_button":false,"tab_2_button":"Discover Soluna","tab_2_link":"","tab_3_label":"You","tab_3_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/We_Are_For_You_3.jpg","tab_3_eyebrow":"Your wellbeing","tab_3_heading":"Come back to yourself","tab_3_body":"<p>Create space to slow down and restore your energy.<\/p>","tab_3_show_button":false,"tab_3_button":"Shop wellness","tab_3_link":""},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_ab0d6b9_VP44BW"],"disabled":true,"settings":{}},"rich_text_CLzYXA":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_ja66yj":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Inspired by the Scandinavian Way of Life","heading_tag":"h2","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":""}},"richtext_eCLB4K":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>For generations, Scandinavian cultures have understood something the modern world is only just beginning to rediscover.<\/p><p>Wellness isn't found in rushing from one thing to the next.<\/p><p>It's found in slowing down.<\/p><p>It's found in creating moments of stillness, embracing nature and making time to care for both body and mind.<\/p><p>That philosophy continues to inspire everything we do.<\/p><p>Our saunas are designed to bring that same sense of balance into everyday living, helping transform gardens and outdoor spaces into places where relaxation feels effortless.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_ja66yj","richtext_eCLB4K"],"name":"Soluna Inspiration","settings":{"full_width":true,"content_width":"large","text_position":"center","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","custom_padding":false,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40}},"rich_text_tPcEFa":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_yk4FrU":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Welcome to Soluna","heading_tag":"h2","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":""}},"richtext_9EGNdR":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>Whether you're taking your first step into the world of home wellness or designing a bespoke outdoor retreat you've dreamed about for years, we're delighted you're here.<\/p><p>Thank you for considering Soluna to be part of your journey.<\/p><p>We hope that every sauna we create becomes more than just another addition to your home.<\/p><p>We hope it becomes your favourite place to pause, recharge and reconnect.<\/p><p>Because at Soluna, we believe the greatest luxury isn't found in owning more.<\/p><p>It's found in making more time for what truly matters.<\/p><p><em><strong>Welcome to Soluna.<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p><em><strong>Where Wellness Lives.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_yk4FrU","richtext_9EGNdR"],"name":"Welcome to Soluna","settings":{"full_width":true,"content_width":"large","text_position":"center","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","custom_padding":false,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40}}},"order":["main","blocks_PCcMBr","rich_text_JGmU6x","17868690308f348f71","rich_text_CLzYXA","rich_text_tPcEFa"]}